{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "04", "m": "11", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "03", "M": "43", "S": "02"}}, "news": [{"title": "Prestige Estates acquires Gloind Vintage Infra at \u20b9519 crore enterprise value", "para": "Prestige Retail Ventures has successfully concluded the acquisition of Gloind Vintage Infra, valuing the enterprise at approximately \u20b9519 crore. The venture involved acquiring 100% equity of Gloind for \u20b95 lakh, granting PRVL complete authority. This move not only bolsters their holdings but also brings Tarun Realtors, a wholly owned subsidiary of Gloind, under Prestige Estates Projects\u2019 expanding portfolio.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/prestige-estates-acquires-gloind-vintage-infra-at-519-crore-enterprise-value/135521031?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-60698/135521031.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Haryana cabinet approves land pooling policy-2026; landowners to get 50% of saleable area", "para": "Haryana's Cabinet has greenlit the Land Pooling Policy-2026, updating the previous Land Pooling Policy-2022. This new policy allows landowners to keep 50 percent of the project's saleable area according to the approved layout. Moreover, they will receive Rs 1 lakh per acre annually for four years following the sale deed registration.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/haryana-cabinet-approves-land-pooling-policy-2026-landowners-to-get-50-of-saleable-area/135520684?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-453132/135520684.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Kolte-Patil Developers posts \u20b95.70 crore net profit in Q2 FY27", "para": "Kolte-Patil Developers showcased impressive financial growth with a consolidated net profit of \u20b95.70 crore for Q2 FY27. The company saw its total income soar to \u20b9351.51 crore, a significant jump from \u20b9161.75 crore. Record pre-sales of \u20b91,019 crore marked a remarkable 52 percent increase year-on-year. For H1 FY27, the total income hit \u20b91,288.13 crore, rising from \u20b9258.56 crore in the last fiscal year, signaling a robust performance.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/kolte-patil-developers-posts-5-70-crore-net-profit-in-q2-fy27/135520306?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-58586/135520306.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}]}